      "id": "en:body",
      "locale": "en_US",
      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Seraphine unleashes a heavy soundwave, dealing (70/100/130/160/190 + (50% Ability Power)) magic damage to enemies in a line and Slowing them by 99% for 1.1/1.2/1.3/1.4/1.5 seconds. Enemies that are already Slowed are Rooted instead, and Immobilized enemies are Stunned. Deals 70% damage against minions.",
      "variant": null
    },
